{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo</strong> of <strong>Teddy Roller 2</strong> that takes you through the first world of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional Modes and levels are not included. The demo offers a good introduction to the core game mechanics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teddy Roller 2</strong> is an arcade game with physics elements. The goal is to navigate various levels and reach the goal at the end of each stage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character balances on a ball of yarn as various creatures seek to knock him off balance and fling him to the ground. The game offers an intuitive blend of rolling ball physics and precision platforming.\u00a0</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031640?t=1758151565","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031640?t=1758151565","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031640/16919075bd2cc2b86acf3f74d29440c0d5187aaa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758151565","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031640/16919075bd2cc2b86acf3f74d29440c0d5187aaa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758151565","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo</strong> of <strong>Teddy Roller 2</strong> that takes you through the first world of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"b